msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:17
#: e8820b6f288a429ea8eb7573d2a5fe15
msgid "An *Antenna Tracker* is a system that tracks the location of a vehicle and uses this information to aim a directional antenna."
